f-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mu,d,\\mathcal F,z\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mu,d,\\mathcal F,z\\in V\\)</span> (probability space, sequence, filtration, and zero random variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-probability.md\">../batch08/58-df-probability.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\)</span> (fully parameterized conditional-expectation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MartingaleDifferenceSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MartingaleDifferenceSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}martingale\\text{-}difference\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MartingaleDifferenceSequence}_S(\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mu,d,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,\\Omega)\\land\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\Sigma))\\land\n\\exists z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(z,\\Omega,\\{0\\})\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F(n),\\Omega)\\land\n\\mathcal F(n)\\subseteq\\mathcal F(n+1)\\land\n\\int_\\Omega|d(n)|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\\land\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(\\{x\\in\\Omega\\mid d(n)(x)&lt;r\\}\\in\\mathcal F(n))\\land\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(z,d(n+1),\\mathcal F(n),\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}martingale\\text{-}difference\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MartingaleDifferenceSequence}_S(\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mu,d,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,\\Omega)\\land\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\Sigma))\\land\n\\exists z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(z,\\Omega,\\{0\\})\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F(n),\\Omega)\\land\n\\mathcal F(n)\\subseteq\\mathcal F(n+1)\\land\n\\int_\\Omega|d(n)|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\\land\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(\\{x\\in\\Omega\\mid d(n)(x)&lt;r\\}\\in\\mathcal F(n))\\land\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(z,d(n+1),\\mathcal F(n),\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sequence, filtration, and zero conditional expectation are set-coded functions; no undeclared symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_\\Omega\">\\(0_\\Omega\\)</span> remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e0